{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HYPERFIGHT 2 is the sequel to the original HYPERFIGHT, a fast-paced fighting game with no blocking and a unique meter system that directly ties meter and win condition together. Resource management and space control are critical as the game changes with every interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This installment takes everything up to 11 - expanded movesets, more offensive and defensive options, and fresh new characters alongside returning favorites - while keeping the beloved accessibility of the original.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032970/extras/1fdc676f3be367833b2c8745fdf794c6.poster.avif?t=1768185264\" width=1170 height=598 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032970/extras/1fdc676f3be367833b2c8745fdf794c6.webm?t=1768185264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032970/extras/1fdc676f3be367833b2c8745fdf794c6.mp4?t=1768185264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A fully voiced roster of characters, each with their own unique movesets and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Funky and energetic soundtrack composed by STEEL_PLUS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online multiplayer with rollback netcode and lobbies with up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Local versus, against player and CPU opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Single player Arcade Mode, Training Mode, and Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Full controller support, with rebindable controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > M